DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19900104
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900105
SUMMARY:Guillermo Endara takes power (imposed by a foreign power) (Panama)
DESCRIPTION:Guillermo David Endara Galimany was a Panamanian politician who
  served as the president of Panama from 1989 to 1994.\n\nNew leader: Panam
 a\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guillermo_Endara\nText: Wikipedia
  (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
