UID:1ce937bfe4a5986b@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19900123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900124
SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Soviet Union vs APF (Azerbaijan) (Russia
 )
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Russia (Sov
 iet Union) and APF over control of Azerbaijan\, starting 1990-01-23. This 
 episode was active in 1 year (1990–1990)\, below war level (25–999 bat
 tle deaths a year)\, and ended 1990-01-27.\n\nConflict: Russia\nSource: ht
 tps://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/377\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (j
 dpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
URL:https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/377
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
