DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900128
SUMMARY:Rafael Leonardo Callejas Romero takes power (Honduras)
DESCRIPTION:Rafael Leonardo Callejas Romero was the 31st President of Hondu
 ras from 27 January 1990 to 27 January 1994\, representing the National Pa
 rty of Honduras (PNH).\n\nNew leader: Honduras\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/Rafael_Leonardo_Callejas_Romero\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
