DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900208
SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Papua New Guinea vs BRA (Bougainville)
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Papua New G
 uinea and BRA over control of Bougainville\, starting 1990-02-07. This epi
 sode was active in 1 year (1990–1990)\, below war level (25–999 battle
  deaths a year)\, and ended 1990-10-01.\n\nConflict: Papua New Guinea\nSou
 rce: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/369\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
