SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Pakistan vs MQM
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Pakistan an
 d MQM over control of the government\, starting 1990-02-11. This episode w
 as active in 1 year (1990–1990)\, below war level (25–999 battle death
 s a year)\, and ended 1990-02-11.\n\nConflict: Pakistan\nSource: https://u
 cdp.uu.se/conflict/404\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pag
