DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900213
SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: India vs Kashmir insurgents (Kashmir)
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of India and K
 ashmir insurgents over control of Kashmir\, starting 1990-02-12. This epis
 ode was active in 36 years (1990–2025)\, 5 of them at war level (1\,000+
  battle deaths a year) and was still active in the latest data.\n\nConflic
 t: India\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/364\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
