SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Myanmar vs NMSP (Mon)
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Myanmar (Bu
 rma) and NMSP over control of Mon\, starting 1990-02-13. This episode was 
 active in 1 year (1990–1990)\, below war level (25–999 battle deaths a
  year)\, and ended 1990-03-22.\n\nConflict: Myanmar\nSource: https://ucdp.
 uu.se/conflict/224\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.d
