 ndidate. Slovak National Party intended to nominate Štefan Kvietik who de
 clined to run.\n\nElection: Czechoslovakia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/1990_Czechoslovak_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA
