DESCRIPTION:Indirect presidential elections were held in Bulgaria in July a
 nd August 1990. A new president and vice president were elected by members
  of the Grand National Assembly following the resignation of president Pet
 ar Mladenov on 20 July 1990 less than four months after he was elected in 
 April.\n\nElection: Bulgaria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/July%E
 2%80%93August_1990_Bulgarian_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
