 and Government of Kuwait over control of Kuwait\, starting 1990-08-02. Thi
 s episode was active in 2 years (1990–1991)\, 2 of them at war level (1\
 ,000+ battle deaths a year)\, and ended 1991-03-01.\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSou
