DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900807
SUMMARY:International sanctions against Iraq
DESCRIPTION:On 6 August 1990\, four days after the Iraqi invasion of Kuwait
 \, the United Nations Security Council (UNSC) placed a comprehensive embar
 go on Iraq. The sanctions stayed largely in force until 22 May 2003\, and 
 persisted in part\, including reparations to Kuwait.\n\nSanctions: Iraq\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_sanctions_against_Iraq\
 nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
