DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19900817
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900818
SUMMARY:Log Revolution (Yugoslavia)
DESCRIPTION:The Log Revolution was an insurrection which started on August 
 17\, 1990\, in areas of the Republic of Croatia which were populated signi
 ficantly by ethnic Serbs. A full year of tension\, including minor skirmis
 hes and sabotage\, passed before these events would escalate into the Croa
 tian War of Independence.\n\nProtest: Yugoslavia\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Log_Revolution\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
 pi.pages.dev).
