DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900910
SUMMARY:Helsinki Summit (1990) (Finland)
DESCRIPTION:The Helsinki Summit was a private\, bilateral meeting between A
 merican President George H. W. Bush and Soviet President Mikhail Gorbachev
  that took place in Helsinki\, Finland on September 9\, 1990.\n\nSummit: F
 inland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helsinki_Summit_(1990)\nText
