DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19900913
SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Treaty on the Final Settlement with Respect to Germa
 ny (Russia)
DESCRIPTION:The Treaty on the Final Settlement with Respect to Germany \, m
 ore commonly referred to as the Two Plus Four Agreement \, is an internati
 onal agreement that allowed the reunification of Germany in October 1990.\
 n\nTreaty: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_on_the_Fin
 al_Settlement_with_Respect_to_Germany\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, vi
