DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19901003
SUMMARY:Revolution on Granite (Soviet Union)
DESCRIPTION:The Revolution on Granite was a student-led protest campaign th
 at took place primarily in Kyiv and Western Ukraine in October 1990. Ukrai
 ne was then the Ukrainian Soviet Socialist Republic\, part of the Soviet U
 nion until its declaration of independence on 24 August 1991. The protest 
 was held from 2 October until 17 October 1990.\n\nProtest: Soviet Union\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Revolution_on_Granite\nText: Wikipedi
 a (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
