SUMMARY:German reunification (Germany)
DESCRIPTION:German reunification\, also known as the expansion of the Feder
 al Republic of Germany (BRD)\, was the process of re-establishing Germany 
 as a single sovereign state\, which began on 9 November 1989 and culminate
 d on 3 October 1990 with the dissolution of the German Democratic Republic
  and the integration of its re-established constituent federated states in
 to…\n\nTreaty: Germany\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_reu
 nification\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
