 ment of Rwanda (backed by Government of DR Congo (Zaire)) and FPR over con
 trol of the government\, starting 1990-10-03. This episode was active in 5
  years (1990–1994)\, 2 of them at war level (1\,000+ battle deaths a yea
 r)\, and ended 1994-07-04.\n\nConflict: Rwanda\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se
 /conflict/374\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
