SUMMARY:1990 Austrian legislative election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Austria on 7 October 1990.
  The Social Democratic Party won the most seats\, and retained the grand c
 oalition with the Austrian People's Party. Voter turnout was 86%.\n\nElect
 ion: Austria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1990_Austrian_legislat
 ive_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
