DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19901009
SUMMARY:1990 Temple Mount killings
DESCRIPTION:The 1990 Temple Mount killings\, or the Al Aqsa Massacre\, also
  known as Black Monday\, took place in the Al-Aqsa compound on the Temple 
 Mount\, Jerusalem at 10:30 am on Monday\, October 8\, 1990\, before Zuhr p
 rayer during the third year of the First Intifada.\n\nProtest: Internation
 al\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1990_Temple_Mount_killings\nText
 : Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
