DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19901015
SUMMARY:1990 Azerbaijani Supreme Soviet election (Soviet Union / Russia)
DESCRIPTION:Supreme Soviet elections were held in the Azerbaijan SSR on 30 
 September and 14 October 1990. They were the first multi-party elections i
 n the country.\n\nElection: Soviet Union / Russia\nSource: https://en.wiki
