DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Benin on 2 December 199
 0. The main issues were changing the political system to a multi-party sys
 tem\, with a secondary issue as to whether there should be age limits for 
 the President. The referendum passed with 93% of voters approving the chan
 ge to a multi-party system and 73% in favour of age limits.\n\nReferendum:
