SUMMARY:Alija Izetbegović takes power (Bosnia and Herzegovina)
DESCRIPTION:Alija Izetbegović was a Bosnian politician\, Islamic philosoph
 er and author who served as the president of the presidency of the Republi
 c of Bosnia and Herzegovina from 1990 to 1996. He later served as the firs
 t chairman of the presidency of Bosnia and Herzegovina from 1996 to 1998\,
