SUMMARY:Lech Wałęsa takes power (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:Lech Wałęsa is a Polish statesman\, dissident and Nobel Peace
  Prize laureate who served as the president of Poland between 1990 and 199
 5. After winning the 1990 election\, Wałęsa became the first democratica
 lly elected president of Poland since 1922 and the first-ever Polish presi
 dent elected by popular vote.\n\nNew leader: Poland\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/Lech_Wa%C5%82%C4%99sa\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
