 elephone Coup\, was a military coup in Suriname on 24 December 1990. The c
 oup was carried out by the acting commander-in-chief of the Suriname Natio
 nal Army (SNL)\, Police Chief Ivan Graanoogst.\n\nCoup: Suriname\nSource: 
