SUMMARY:Jorge Serrano Elías takes power (Guatemala)
DESCRIPTION:Jorge Antonio Serrano Elías is a Guatemalan industrial enginee
 r and politician who served as the 41st president of Guatemala from Januar
 y 14\, 1991 to June 1\, 1993. He attempted a self-coup in May 1993 to stay
