DESCRIPTION:A referendum on autonomy was held in the Crimean Oblast of the 
 Ukrainian SSR on 20 January 1991\, two months before the 1991 All-Union re
 ferendum. Voters were asked whether they wanted to re-establish the Crimea
 n Autonomous Soviet Socialist Republic\, which had been abolished in 1945.
  The proposal was approved by 94% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Soviet Union\n
