 and from 2001 to 2004. He lived in exile between the 1991 military coup an
 d 1994\, and again between the 2004 coup and 2011.\n\nNew leader: Haiti\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean-Bertrand_Aristide\nText: Wikiped
