DESCRIPTION:An independence referendum was held in Lithuania on 9 February 
 1991\, eleven months after independence from the Soviet Union had been dec
 lared on 11 March 1990. Just over 93% of those voting voted in favour of i
 ndependence\, while the number of eligible voters voting "yes" was 76.5%\,
  far exceeding the threshold of 50%.\n\nReferendum: Soviet Union / Russia\
 nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1991_Lithuanian_independence_refere
