DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19910503
SUMMARY:Battle of Borovo Selo (Croatia)
DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Borovo Selo of 2 May 1991\, known in Croatia as t
 he Borovo Selo massacre and in Serbia as the Borovo Selo incident\, was on
 e of the first armed clashes in the conflict which became known as the Cro
 atian War of Independence.\n\nConflict: Croatia\nSource: https://en.wikipe
 dia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Borovo_Selo\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
 RP (jdpi.pages.dev).
