DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19910517
SUMMARY:1991 Yemeni constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Yemen on 15 and 16 May 
 1991. The new constitution was reportedly approved by 98.5% of voters\, wi
 th a 72.2% turnout.\n\nReferendum: Yemen\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/1991_Yemeni_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
