SUMMARY:1991 Cypriot legislative election (Cyprus)
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Cyprus on 19 May 1991. The
  result was a victory for the Democratic Rally\, which won 20 of the 56 se
 ats. Voter turnout was 93%.\n\nElection: Cyprus\nSource: https://en.wikipe
 dia.org/wiki/1991_Cypriot_legislative_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
