DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19910609
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19910610
SUMMARY:1991 Italian electoral law referendum (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:An abrogative referendum on the electoral law was held in Italy
  on 9 June 1991. Voters were asked whether the clause of the law on the nu
 mber of preference votes should be scrapped. The result was 95.6% in favou
 r\, with a turnout of 65.1%.\n\nReferendum: Italy\nSource: https://en.wiki
 pedia.org/wiki/1991_Italian_electoral_law_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
