SUMMARY:Mesut Yılmaz takes power (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:Ahmet Mesut Yılmaz was a Turkish politician. He was the leader
  of the Motherland Party from 1991 to 2002\, and served three times as Pri
 me Minister of Turkey. His first two prime-ministerial terms lasted just m
 onths\, while the third ran from June 1997 to January 1999.\n\nNew leader:
  Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mesut_Y%C4%B1lmaz\nText: Wi
 kipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
