SUMMARY:First inauguration of Boris Yeltsin (Russia)
DESCRIPTION:The first inauguration of Boris Yeltsin as president of the Rus
 sian Soviet Federative Socialist Republic (RSFSR) took place on Wednesday\
 , 10 July 1991. The ceremony was held at the State Kremlin Palace and it l
 asted about thirty minutes. It was the first presidential inauguration cer
 emony in the history of Russia.\n\nInauguration: Russia\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_inauguration_of_Boris_Yeltsin\nText: Wikipedia 
 (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
