DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Mauritania on 12 July 1
 991. The new constitution would restore multi-party democracy for the firs
 t time since the 1960s\, as well as creating a bicameral Parliament with a
  Senate and National Assembly. The constitution would not include term lim
 its for the President.\n\nReferendum: Mauritania\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/1991_Mauritanian_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia 
 (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
