SUMMARY:Coup: 1991 Soviet coup attempt (Soviet Union)
DESCRIPTION:In August 1991\, hardliners of the Communist Party of the Sovie
 t Union (CPSU) attempted to forcibly seize control of the country from Mik
 hail Gorbachev\, who was Soviet president and General Secretary of the CPS
 U at the time.\n\nCoup: Soviet Union\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
 i/1991_Soviet_coup_attempt\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi
 .pages.dev).
