DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19910826
SUMMARY:Battle of Vukovar (Croatia)
DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Vukovar was an 87-day siege of Vukovar in eastern
  Croatia by the Yugoslav People's Army (JNA)\, supported by various parami
 litary forces from Serbia\, between August and November 1991. Before the C
 roatian War of Independence the Baroque town was a prosperous\, mixed comm
 unity of Croats\, Serbs and other ethnic groups.\n\nConflict: Croatia\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Vukovar\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
