SUMMARY:1991 Armenian independence referendum
DESCRIPTION:An independence referendum was held in the Armenia SSR on 21 Se
 ptember 1991 to determine whether Armenia should secede from the Soviet Un
 ion. It followed a declaration of independence on 23 August 1990. 99.5% of
  voters voted in favour\, with a turnout of 95%. The country officially be
 came an independent state on 23 September 1991.\n\nReferendum: Armenia\nSo
 urce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1991_Armenian_independence_referendum\
