DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19920113
SUMMARY:1992 Malian constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Mali on 12 January 1992
 . The new constitution would restore multi-party democracy\, create a divi
 sion of powers between the President and National Assembly\, and set a pre
 sidential term of five limits. It was approved by 99% of voters with a 44%
  turnout.\n\nReferendum: Mali\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_
 Malian_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP
  (jdpi.pages.dev).
