 ina)
DESCRIPTION:The attack on the Israeli embassy in Buenos Aires was a suicide
  bombing attack on the building of the Israeli embassy of Argentina\, loca
 ted in Buenos Aires\, which was carried out on 17 March 1992. 29 civilians
  were killed in the attack and 242 additional civilians were injured.\n\nC
 risis: Argentina\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_Buenos_Aires_
