SUMMARY:P. J. Patterson takes power (Jamaica)
DESCRIPTION:Percival Noel James Patterson\,\, popularly known as P. J. Patt
 erson\, is a Jamaican former politician who served as the sixth prime mini
 ster of Jamaica from 1992 to 2006. He served in office for 14 years\, maki
 ng him the longest-serving prime minister in Jamaica's history. He was the
  leader of the People's National Party from 1992 to 2006.\n\nNew leader: J
 amaica\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/P._J._Patterson\nText: Wikip
