DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19920406
SUMMARY:1992 anti-war protests in Sarajevo (Bosnia and Herzegovina)
DESCRIPTION:On 5 April 1992\, in response to events all over Bosnia and Her
 zegovina 100\,000 people of all nationalities turned out for a peace rally
  in Sarajevo. Serb Democratic Party (SDS) snipers in the Holiday Inn in th
 e heart of Sarajevo opened fire on the crowd\, killing six people and woun
 ding several more.\n\nProtest: Bosnia and Herzegovina\nSource: https://en.
 wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_anti-war_protests_in_Sarajevo\nText: Wikipedia (CC
  BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
