DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19920406
SUMMARY:1992 Italian general election (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Italy on 5 and 6 April 1992. The
 y were the first without the traditionally second most important political
  force in Italian politics\, the Italian Communist Party (PCI)\, which had
  been disbanded in 1991.\n\nElection: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/1992_Italian_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
 ia PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
