 held under communist control and featured the unprecedented use of televis
 ion\, posters\, and other media by multiple candidates to communicate plat
 forms and solicit votes.\n\nElection: Azerbaijan\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/1992_Azerbaijani_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
