SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Via D'Amelio bombing (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:The via D'Amelio bombing was a terrorist attack by the Sicilian
  Mafia\, which took place in Palermo\, Sicily\, Italy\, on 19 July 1992. I
 t killed Paolo Borsellino\, the anti-Mafia Italian magistrate\, and five m
 embers of his police escort: Agostino Catalano\, Emanuela Loi\, Vincenzo L
 i Muli\, Walter Eddie Cosina\, and Claudio Traina.\n\nCrisis: Italy\nSourc
 e: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Via_D%27Amelio_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (
