DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Croatia on 2 August 1992\,
  alongside presidential elections. They were the first elections after ind
 ependence and under the new constitution. All 138 seats in the Chamber of 
 Representatives were up for election. The result was a victory for the Cro
 atian Democratic Union\, which won an absolute majority of 85 seats.\n\nEl
 ection: Croatia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_Croatian_parli
