 dowing the breakup of Czechoslovakia. Incumbent President Václav Havel pa
 rticipated in the first ballot held on 3 July 1992. He ran unopposed but f
 ailed to receive enough votes from Slovak MPs to be re-elected.\n\nElectio
 n: Czechoslovakia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_Czechoslovak
