SUMMARY:1992 Nigerien constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Niger on 26 December 19
 92. The new constitution would restore multi-party democracy for the first
  time since 1960\, whilst also allowing unlimited number of five-year term
 s for the President. It was approved by 89.79% of voters\, with a turnout 
 of 56.6%.\n\nReferendum: Niger\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992
