 he prime minister of Slovakia from June 1990 to May 1991\, June 1992 to Ma
 rch 1994\, and again from December 1994 to October 1998. He was the leader
  of the Movement for a Democratic Slovakia (HZDS)\, a populist party in Sl
 ovakia.\n\nNew leader: Slovakia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vla
