DESCRIPTION:START II was a bilateral treaty between the United States and R
 ussia on the Reduction and Limitation of Strategic Offensive Arms. It was 
 signed by US president George H. W. Bush and Russian president Boris Yelts
 in on 3 January 1993\, banning the use of multiple independently targetabl
 e re-entry vehicles (MIRVs) on intercontinental ballistic missiles (ICBMs)
 .\n\nTreaty: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/START_II\nText:
