DESCRIPTION:William Jefferson Clinton is an American retired politician and
  lawyer who served as the 42nd president of the United States from 1993 to
  2001. A member of the Democratic Party\, he previously served as the atto
 rney general of Arkansas from 1977 to 1979\, the governor of Arkansas from
  1979 to 1981\, and governor again from 1983 to 1992.\n\nNew leader: Unite
 d States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Clinton\nText: Wikipe
 dia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
