SUMMARY:Battle: Operation Maslenica (Croatia)
DESCRIPTION:Operation Maslenica was a Croatian Army offensive launched in J
 anuary 1993 to retake territory in northern Dalmatia and Lika from Krajina
  Serb forces\, with the stated military objective of pushing the Serbs bac
 k from approaches to Zadar\, Maslenica and Karlobag\, allowing a secure la
 nd route between Dalmatia and northern Croatia to be opened.\n\nConflict: 
 Croatia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Maslenica\nText: 
