SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 1993 Bombay bombings (India)
DESCRIPTION:The 1993 Bombay bombings was a series of 12 terrorist bombings 
 in Bombay\, Maharashtra\, on 12 March 1993. The single-day attacks resulte
 d in 257 fatalities and 1\,400 injuries. The bombings took place in the af
 termath of the Bombay riots\, which themselves had followed the demolition
  of the five-century-old Babri Masjid in Ayodhya by a Hindutva mob.\n\nCri
 sis: India\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1993_Bombay_bombings\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
