SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 1993 Solingen arson attack (Germany)
DESCRIPTION:The Solingen arson attack was one of the most severe instances 
 of racist violence in modern Germany. On the night of 28–29 May 1993\, f
 our young German men belonging to the far right skinhead scene\, with neo-
 Nazi ties\, set fire to the house of a large Turkish family in the city of
  Solingen\, in the state of North Rhine-Westphalia\, Germany.\n\nCrisis: G
 ermany\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1993_Solingen_arson_attack\n
 Text: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
