SUMMARY:Battle of Mogadishu (1993) (Somalia)
DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Mogadishu\, also known as the Black Hawk Down Inc
 ident\, was part of Operation Gothic Serpent. It was fought on 3–4 Octob
 er 1993\, in Mogadishu\, Somalia\, between forces of the United States—s
 upported by UNOSOM II—against Somali National Alliance (SNA) fighters an
 d other insurgents in south Mogadishu.\n\nConflict: Somalia\nSource: https
 ://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Mogadishu_(1993)\nText: Wikipedia (CC B
