DESCRIPTION:The Rwandan genocide\, also known as the genocide against Tutsi
 \, occurred from 7 April to 19 July 1994 during the Rwandan Civil War. Ove
 r a span of approximately 100 days\, members of the Tutsi ethnic group\, a
 s well as some moderate Hutu and Twa\, were systematically killed by Hutu 
 militias.\n\nCrisis: Rwanda\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rwandan
 _genocide\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
