 ion of 5 May 1994 on the Constitutional law (Bundesverfassungsgesetz) conc
 erning the Accession of Austria to the European Union be enacted as law?" 
 The result of the vote was 67% in favour\, with a turnout of 82%.\n\nRefer
 endum: Austria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Austrian_Europe
