DESCRIPTION:Early presidential elections were held in Ukraine on 26 June 19
 94\, with a second round on 10 July. They were held ahead of schedule foll
 owing a compromise between President Leonid Kravchuk and the Verkhovna Rad
 a\, the Ukrainian parliament. The elections saw Kravchuk defeated by his f
 ormer Prime Minister Leonid Kuchma.\n\nElection: Ukraine\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Ukrainian_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedi
 a (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
