DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19940719
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: AMIA bombing (Argentina)
DESCRIPTION:The Asociación Mutual Israelita Argentina\, a Jewish community
  center in Buenos Aires\, Argentina\, was bombed on 18 July 1994. Executed
  as a suicide attack\, a bomb-laden van was driven into the AMIA building 
 and subsequently detonated\, killing 85 people and injuring over 300. To d
 ate\, the bombing remains the deadliest terrorist attack in Argentine hist
 ory.\n\nCrisis: Argentina\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AMIA_bomb
 ing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
