DESCRIPTION:In the 1994 Gambian coup d'état\, a group of soldiers led by 2
 9-year-old Lieutenant Yahya Jammeh seized power in a coup d'état on the m
 orning of 22 July\, ousting Dawda Jawara\, who had been President of The G
 ambia since it became a Republic in 1970.\n\nCoup: The Gambia\nSource: htt
 ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Gambian_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedi
