SUMMARY:1994 Mexican general election (Mexico)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Mexico on 21 August 1994. The pr
 esidential elections resulted in a victory for Ernesto Zedillo of the Inst
 itutional Revolutionary Party (PRI)\, whilst the PRI won 300 of the 500 se
 ats in the Chamber of Deputies and 95 of the 128 seats in the Senate.\n\nE
 lection: Mexico\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Mexican_genera
 l_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
