DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19940823
SUMMARY:Wim Kok takes power (Netherlands)
DESCRIPTION:Willem "Wim" Kok was a Dutch politician and trade union leader 
 who served as Prime Minister of the Netherlands from 22 August 1994 until 
 22 July 2002. He was a member of the Labour Party (PvdA).\n\nNew leader: N
 etherlands\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wim_Kok\nText: Wikipedia
  (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
