DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19940828
SUMMARY:1994 Lithuanian privatisation referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on a law revoking privatisation deals was held in 
 Lithuania on 27 August 1994. The proposed law put forward procedures for r
 eversing privatisation deals conducted in a non-transparent manner\, as we
 ll as compensating citizens for the loss of savings caused by inflation.\n
 \nReferendum: Lithuania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Lithua
