  on 8 August. The plan would give 49% of Bosnia and Herzegovina to Serbs\,
  around a third less than they held at the time. It was rejected by 97% of
  voters.\n\nReferendum: Bosnia and Herzegovina\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/1994_Republika_Srpska_Contact_Group_partition_plan_referendum\
