DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19940908
SUMMARY:Owen Arthur takes power (Barbados)
DESCRIPTION:Owen Seymour Arthur was a Barbadian politician who served as th
 e fifth prime minister of Barbados from 6 September 1994 to 15 January 200
 8. He is the longest-serving Barbadian prime minister to date. He also ser
 ved as Leader of the Opposition from 1 August 1993 to 6 September 1994 and
  from 23 October 2010 to 21 February 2013.\n\nNew leader: Barbados\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Owen_Arthur\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
 )\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
