SUMMARY:1994 Finnish European Union membership referendum (Finland)
DESCRIPTION:An advisory referendum on joining the European Union was held i
 n Finland on 16 October 1994. 56.9% of voters approved of the proposal\, w
 ith a voter turnout of 70.8%. Due to having its own customs jurisdiction\,
  a separate referendum was held in Åland a month later\, and was also app
 roved.\n\nReferendum: Finland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_
 Finnish_European_Union_membership_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
 0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
