DESCRIPTION:A federal election was held in Germany on 16 October 1994 to el
 ect the members of the 13th Bundestag. The CDU/CSU alliance led by Helmut 
 Kohl remained the largest faction in parliament\, with Kohl remaining Chan
 cellor in a narrowly re-elected coalition with the Free Democratic Party (
 FDP).\n\nElection: West Germany / Germany\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.or
