DESCRIPTION:Reneta Ivanova Indzhova is a Bulgarian economist who served as 
 the caretaker Prime Minister of Bulgaria from 1994 to 1995\, appointed by 
 President Zhelyu Zhelev. A political independent\, she is the first woman 
 to have served as Prime Minister in Bulgaria.\n\nNew leader: Bulgaria\nSou
