DESCRIPTION:Queen Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and N
 orthern Ireland\, her husband Prince Philip\, Duke of Edinburgh and Foreig
 n Secretary Douglas Hurd made a state visit to Russia from 17 to 20 Octobe
 r 1994\, hosted by the President of Russia\, Boris Yeltsin. It is the firs
 t and so far only visit by a reigning British monarch on Russian soil.\n\n
 Summit: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_visit_by_Eliza
