DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Burundi and
  CNDD over control of the government\, starting 1994-10-18. This episode w
 as active in 13 years (1994–2006)\, 4 of them at war level (1\,000+ batt
 le deaths a year)\, and ended 2006-09-26.\n\nConflict: Burundi\nSource: ht
