DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Kyrgyzstan on 22 Octobe
 r 1994. Voters were asked questions on two topics:Whether they approved of
  using referendums to decide on amendments to the constitution\, laws and 
 other important questions of political life. Whether they approved of the 
 introduction of a bicameral parliament.\n\nReferendum: Kyrgyzstan\nSource:
