 itician who served as the Prime Minister of Estonia from 1994 to 1995. He 
 was also a Member of the European Parliament (MEP) for the Social Democrat
 ic Party\, part of the Party of European Socialists\, between 2004 and 200
 9.\n\nNew leader: Estonia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andres_Ta
