 as held in Sweden on 13 November 1994. 53% of voters voted in favour\, wit
 h a turnout of 83%. Later Sweden joined EU in January 1\, 1995.\n\nReferen
 dum: Sweden\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Swedish_European_U
