SUMMARY:1994 Ålandic European Union membership referendum (Finland)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on European Union membership was held in Åland\, 
 Finland on 20 November 1994. Although a nationwide referendum had been hel
 d in Finland on 16 October\, the islands held another separate vote as the
 y were a separate customs jurisdiction. EU membership was approved by 74% 
 of voters.\n\nReferendum: Finland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1
 994_%C3%85landic_European_Union_membership_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC
  BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
