DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19941128
SUMMARY:November 1994 Uruguayan referendum
DESCRIPTION:A double constitutional referendum was held in Uruguay on 27 No
 vember 1994 alongside general elections. Voters were asked two questions\;
  whether they approved of two initiatives\, one on preventing cuts in pens
 ion payments\, and one on the proportion of the state budget spent on educ
 ation. The first question was approved\, whilst the second was rejected.\n
 \nReferendum: Uruguay\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_1994
 _Uruguayan_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
