DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19941128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19941129
SUMMARY:1994 Norwegian European Union membership referendum (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on joining the European Union was held in Norway o
 n 27 and 28 November 1994. After a long period of heated debate\, the "no"
  side won with 52.2 per cent of the vote\, on a turnout of 88.6 per cent. 
 Membership of what was then the European Community had previously been rej
 ected in a 1972 referendum\, and by French veto in 1962.\n\nReferendum: No
 rway\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Norwegian_European_Union_
 membership_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_Norwegian_European_Union_membership_
 referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
