SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Philippine Airlines Flight 434 (Japan)
DESCRIPTION:Philippine Airlines Flight 434 was a scheduled flight on Decemb
 er 11\, 1994\, from Manila to Tokyo with a quick stopover in Cebu on a Boe
 ing 747-200 that was seriously damaged by a bomb\, killing one passenger a
 nd damaging vital control systems\, although the plane was in a repairable
  state.\n\nCrisis: Japan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philippine
 _Airlines_Flight_434\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages
