SUMMARY:Kaspar Villiger takes power (Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:Kaspar Villiger is a Swiss businessman\, former tobacco manufac
 turer and politician. He served as a member of the Federal Council (Switze
 rland) since 1 February 1989 for The Liberals. Villiger served two terms a
 s President of the Swiss Confederation in 1995 and again in 2002.\n\nNew l
 eader: Switzerland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaspar_Villiger\
 nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
