DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19950118
SUMMARY:Lamberto Dini takes power (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:Lamberto Dini is an Italian politician and economist. He was th
 e Director General of Bank of Italy from 1979 to 1994\, Minister of Treasu
 ry from 1994 to 1996\, the 51st prime minister of Italy from 1995 to 1996\
 , and Foreign Minister from 1996 to 2001. At 95 years old\, he is the olde
 st living prime minister of Italy.\n\nNew leader: Italy\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamberto_Dini\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
 RP (jdpi.pages.dev).
