SUMMARY:Jean-Claude Juncker takes power (Luxembourg)
DESCRIPTION:Jean-Claude Juncker is a Luxembourgish politician who was prime
  minister of Luxembourg from 1995 to 2013 and president of the European Co
 mmission from 2014 to 2019. He was also Luxembourg's Finance Minister from
  1989 to 2009 and President of the Eurogroup from 2005 to 2013.\n\nNew lea
 der: Luxembourg\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean-Claude_Juncker
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
