DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19950126
SUMMARY:Zhan Videnov takes power (Bulgaria)
DESCRIPTION:Zhan Vasilev Videnov\, sometimes spelled in English as Jean Vid
 enov\, was Prime Minister of Bulgaria from 25 January 1995 until 13 Februa
 ry 1997\, a term remembered for the most severe economic and financial cri
 sis in recent Bulgarian history\, which featured hyperinflation and a dras
 tic fall in living standards.\n\nNew leader: Bulgaria\nSource: https://en.
 wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhan_Videnov\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP 
