SUMMARY:1995 Gagauz autonomy referendums (Moldova)
DESCRIPTION:Local referendums were held in several localities of southern M
 oldova on 5 March 1995 to determine the territory of Gagauzia. 30 of the 3
 6 communes voted to join the new Autonomous Territorial Unit of Gagauzia. 
 In Svetlîi commune\, results were invalidated due to voting irregularitie
 s\, and another referendum was held on 26 March 1995.\n\nReferendum: Moldo
 va\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1995_Gagauz_autonomy_referendums
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
