SUMMARY:1995 Dominican general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Dominica on 12 June 1995. Althou
 gh the Dominica Freedom Party received the most votes\, the United Workers
 ' Party won 11 of the 21 seats. Voter turnout was 65.2%\, the lowest since
  universal suffrage was introduced in 1951.\n\nElection: Dominica\nSource:
