DESCRIPTION:The second indirect presidential election was held in Hungary o
 n 19 June 1995. Incumbent President Árpád Göncz was re-elected for a se
 cond term with two-third majority. Until 2026\, this was the last election
  not won by a candidate supported by Fidesz.\n\nElection: Hungary\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1995_Hungarian_presidential_election\nText:
