SUMMARY:Coup: 1995 Qatari coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:A bloodless palace coup took place in Qatar on 27 June 1995. Th
 e coup was carried out by Crown Prince Hamad bin Khalifa Al Thani who\, wi
 th the support of the ruling Al Thani family\, took control of the country
  while his father\, Emir Khalifa bin Hamad Al Thani\, was on a visit to Ge
 neva\, Switzerland.\n\nCoup: Qatar\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
