 red the founder of the Italian centre-left and one of the most prominent f
 igures of the Second Republic.\n\nNew leader: Italy\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/Romano_Prodi\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (j
 dpi.pages.dev).
