SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Zaire vs AFDL (DR Congo)
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records an internationalised civil conflict between Govern
 ment of DR Congo (Zaire) and AFDL (backed by Government of Rwanda) over co
 ntrol of the government\, starting 1996-10-19. This episode was active in 
 6 years (1996–2001)\, 5 of them at war level (1\,000+ battle deaths a ye
 ar)\, and ended 2001-09-29.\n\nConflict: DR Congo\nSource: https://ucdp.uu
 .se/conflict/283\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev
 ).
