DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19961020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19961021
SUMMARY:1996 Comorian constitutional referendum (Comoros)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in the Comoros on 20 Octob
 er 1996. The proposed amendments would set the presidential term at 6 year
 s\, create a unicameral parliament\, and limit the authority of the indivi
 dual islands' parliaments. The proposals were approved by 85% of voters\, 
 with a turnout of around 64%.\n\nReferendum: Comoros\nSource: https://en.w
 ikipedia.org/wiki/1996_Comorian_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia
  (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1996_Comorian_constitutional_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
