SUMMARY:1996 Maltese general election (Malta)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Malta on 26 October 1996. Althou
 gh the Malta Labour Party received the most votes\, the Nationalist Party 
 won the most seats. However\, the Labour Party was awarded an additional f
 our seats to ensure they had a majority in Parliament.\n\nElection: Malta\
 nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1996_Maltese_general_election\nText
