 DFB over control of Bodoland\, starting 1996-10-28. This episode was activ
 e in 4 years (1996–1999)\, below war level (25–999 battle deaths a yea
 r)\, and ended 1999-10-07.\n\nConflict: India\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/
