DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Slovenia on 10 November 19
 96. The result was a victory for Liberal Democracy of Slovenia\, which won
  25 of the 90 seats. Party leader Janez Drnovšek was re-elected Prime Min
 ister by the Parliament on 9 January 1997.\n\nElection: Slovenia\nSource: 
