DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19961125
SUMMARY:APEC Philippines 1996
DESCRIPTION:APEC Philippines 1996 was a series of Asia-Pacific Economic Coo
 peration meetings focused on economic cooperation\, held on 24 and 25 Nove
 mber 1996 at the Subic Bay Freeport Zone in Olongapo City and other locati
 ons in the Philippines. It was the eighth APEC meeting\, and the first hel
 d in the Philippines.\n\nSummit: Philippines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/APEC_Philippines_1996\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP 
