DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Moldova on 17 November 1996
 \, with a second round on 1 December. Whilst incumbent President Mircea Sn
 egur received the most votes in the first round\, he was defeated in the s
 econd by Petru Lucinschi.\n\nElection: Moldova\nSource: https://en.wikiped
