DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the electoral system was held in Slovenia on 8 
 December 1996. Voters were given three options to approve or not\; a compe
 nsatory system\, a two-round majority system and a proportional representa
 tion system at a national level.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1996_Slovenian_electoral_system_referendum\nText: Wi
 kipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
