SUMMARY:1996 Uruguayan constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Uruguay on 8 December 1
 996. The proposals\, which included limiting each party to a single presid
 ential candidate\, were narrowly approved by voters.\n\nReferendum: Urugua
 y\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1996_Uruguayan_constitutional_ref
 erendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
