SUMMARY:Arnold Koller takes power (Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:Arnold Koller is a Swiss professor and politician. He served as
  a member of the Federal Council from 1987 to 1999 for the Christian Democ
 ratic People's Party (CVP). Koller previously served as a member of the Na
 tional Council from 1971 to 1986. He did also serve two terms of the as Pr
 esident of the Swiss Confederation in 1990 and 1997.\n\nNew leader: Switze
 rland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnold_Koller\nText: Wikipedi
