SUMMARY:Arnoldo Alemán takes power (Nicaragua)
DESCRIPTION:José Arnoldo Alemán Lacayo is a Nicaraguan politician who ser
 ved as the president of Nicaragua from 10 January 1997 to 10 January 2002.
  His tenure as president was marked by corruption and attempts to centrali
