 It was decreed by then-President Aleksander Kwaśniewski on the day the Na
 tional Assembly adopted the Constitution. Voters were asked whether they a
 pproved of a new constitution\, and replace the temporary constitution fro
 m 1992. It was narrowly approved\, with 53.45% voting in favour.\n\nRefere
 ndum: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1997_Polish_constituti
 onal_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev)
