 áil politician who served as Taoiseach from 1997 to 2008\, and as Leader 
 of Fianna Fáil from 1994 to 2008. A Teachta Dála (TD) from 1977 to 2011\
 , he served as Leader of the Opposition from 1994 to 1997.\n\nNew leader: 
