DESCRIPTION:The handover of Hong Kong from the United Kingdom of Great Brit
 ain and Northern Ireland to the People's Republic of China occurred at mid
 night on 1 July 1997. This event ended 156 years of British rule\, dating 
 back to the capture of Hong Kong Island in 1841 during the First Opium War
 .\n\nTreaty: China\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handover_of_Hong
