 ending the Treaty on European Union\, the Treaties establishing the Europe
 an Communities and certain related acts\, was signed on 2 October 1997\, a
 nd entered into force on 1 May 1999\; it made substantial changes to the M
 aastricht Treaty\, which had been signed in 1992.\n\nTreaty: Netherlands\n
 Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Amsterdam\nText: Wikipedia
