SUMMARY:1997 Anjouan independence referendum (Comoros)
DESCRIPTION:An independence referendum was held on Anjouan\, an island in t
 he Comoros\, on 26 October 1997. Over 99% of voters voted in favour of ind
 ependence. However\, the vote was not recognised and the island returned t
