 writer and poet who served as Prime Minister of Romania from 17 April 1998
  to 13 December 1999. A leading member of the Christian Democratic Nationa
 l Peasants' Party (PNȚ-CD)\, he played a prominent role within the Romani
 an Democratic Convention (CDR).\n\nNew leader: Romania\nSource: https://en
