SUMMARY:May 1998 Indonesia riots
DESCRIPTION:The May 1998 Indonesia riots\, also known colloquially as the 1
 998 tragedy or simply the 98 event\, were incidents of riots and civil unr
 est in Indonesia\, many of which targeted the country's ethnic Chinese pop
