 nto force on 1 July 2002. As of January 2025\, 125 states are party to the
  statute.\n\nTreaty: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rome_Sta
 tute\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
