 essary for the referendum to succeed. If it had passed\, Nevis would have 
 seceded from the Federation of Saint Kitts and Nevis.\n\nReferendum: Saint
  Kitts and Nevis\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998_Nevis_indepen
