SUMMARY:Massimo D'Alema takes power (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:Massimo D'Alema is an Italian politician and journalist who was
  the 53rd prime minister of Italy from 1998 to 2000. He was Deputy Prime M
 inister of Italy and Italian Minister of Foreign Affairs from 2006 to 2008
 . D'Alema also served for a time as national secretary of the Democratic P
 arty of the Left (PDS).\n\nNew leader: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/Massimo_D%27Alema\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Massimo_D%27Alema
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
