SUMMARY:Mikuláš Dzurinda takes power (Slovakia)
DESCRIPTION:Mikuláš Dzurinda is a Slovak politician who was the prime min
 ister of Slovakia from 30 October 1998 to 4 July 2006. Dzurinda is the fou
