  November 1998 in Buenos Aires\, Argentina. The conference included the 4t
 h Conference of the Parties (COP4) to the United Nations Framework Convent
 ion on Climate Change (UNFCCC). It had been expected that the remaining is
 sues unresolved in Kyoto would be finalized at this meeting.\n\nSummit: Ar
