DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the Nouméa Accord was held in New Caledonia on
  8 November 1998. It was approved by 71.85% of voters. The proportion of v
 oters in favour was highest in the Loyalty Islands and lowest in the South
  Province.\n\nReferendum: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/19
