DESCRIPTION:A referendum on creating administrative regions was held in Por
 tugal on 8 November 1998. Two questions were put to voters\, the first on 
 implementing the regions\, and the second specifically asked whether voter
 s approved of the new region for their area. Both proposals were rejected 
 by wide margins by voters.\n\nReferendum: Portugal\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/1998_Portuguese_regionalisation_referendum\nText: Wikipedi
