SUMMARY:Mart Laar takes power (Estonia)
DESCRIPTION:Mart Laar is an Estonian politician and historian. He served as
  the Prime Minister of Estonia from 1992 to 1994 and from 1999 to 2002. La
 ar is credited with having helped bring about Estonia's rapid economic dev
 elopment during the 1990s. He is a member of the centre-right Isamaa party
 .\n\nNew leader: Estonia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mart_Laar\
 nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
