SUMMARY:Battle of Košare (Albania)
DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Košare was fought during the Kosovo War between 
 the forces of FR Yugoslavia and the Kosovo Liberation Army (KLA)\, the lat
 ter supported by the NATO air forces and Albanian Army. The battle was fou
 ght around Košare on the border between FR Yugoslavia and Albania from 9 
 April 1999 until 10 June 1999 during the NATO bombing of FR Yugoslavia.\n\
 nConflict: Albania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Ko%C5%
 A1are\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
