DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19990411
SUMMARY:Assassination of Ali Sayyad Shirazi (Iran)
DESCRIPTION:On 10 April 1999\, 6:45 a.m local time\, Ali Sayyad Shirazi\, t
 he deputy chief of staff of the Iranian Armed Forces\, was assassinated wh
 ile leaving his home for work. He was killed by an Mojahedin-e Khalq (MEK)
  assailant\, an Iranian opposition group\, who was disguised as a street c
 leaner and handed Shirazi a letter just before shooting him.\n\nAssassinat
 ion: Iran\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Sayy
 ad_Shirazi\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Assassination
