SUMMARY:1999 Italian referendum (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:An abrogative referendum on the electoral law was held in Italy
  on 18 April 1999. Voters were asked whether they approved of replacing th
 e mixed-member proportional representation electoral system with one based
  solely on single-member constituencies\, with the 25% of seats instead al
 located to the second-placed in the constituencies with the most votes.\n\
 nReferendum: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Italian_ref
 erendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
