DESCRIPTION:A referendum on convening a Constituent Assembly was held in Ve
 nezuela on 25 April 1999. It was promoted by President Hugo Chávez\, with
  voters asked two questions on convening a National Constituent Assembly a
 nd how that body should be elected. Both proposals were approved by over 8
 0% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Venezuela\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
 iki/April_1999_Venezuelan_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC B
 Y-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
