SUMMARY:1999 Icelandic parliamentary election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Iceland on 8 May 1999. The
  Independence Party remained the largest party in the Althing\, winning 26
  of the 63 seats. The coalition government of the Independence Party and P
 rogressive Party remained in office\, with Davíð Oddsson continuing as P
 rime Minister.\n\nElection: Iceland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
 /1999_Icelandic_parliamentary_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
