SUMMARY:1999 Belarusian presidential election
DESCRIPTION:The 1999 Belarusian presidential election was a political prote
 st action by members of Belarusian opposition who did not recognise the 19
 96 constitutional reform which extended Alexander Lukashenko's presidentia
 l term.\n\nElection: Belarus\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_B
 elarusian_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP 
