DESCRIPTION:A consultative constitutional referendum was held in Moldova on
  23 May 1999. It was initiated by President Petru Lucinschi and asked vote
 rs whether they approved of changing the system of government to a preside
 ntial system. The proposal was approved by 64% of voters.\n\nReferendum: M
 oldova\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Moldovan_constitutional
 _referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
