DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19990529
SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Montreal Convention (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:The Montreal Convention is a multilateral treaty adopted on 28 
 May 1999 by member states of the International Civil Aviation Organization
  (ICAO) and entered into force on 4 November 2003. It updated and replaced
  parts of the earlier Warsaw Convention and Hague Protocol\, which had gov
 erned international air travel since the early 20th century.\n\nTreaty: Ca
 nada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montreal_Convention\nText: Wik
 ipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
