DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19990530
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19990531
SUMMARY:1999 Armenian parliamentary election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Armenia on 30 May 1999. Th
 ere were 75 constituency seats and 56 elected on a national basis using pr
 oportional representation. The result was a victory for the Unity Bloc\, w
 hich won 62 of the 131 seats.\n\nElection: Armenia\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/1999_Armenian_parliamentary_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
