SUMMARY:Francisco Flores Pérez takes power (El Salvador)
DESCRIPTION:Francisco Guillermo Flores Pérez was a Salvadoran politician w
 ho served as the 39th President of El Salvador from 1 June 1999 to 1 June 
 2004 as a member of the conservative Nationalist Republican Alliance (AREN
 A). He previously served as a deputy of the Legislative Assembly from 1994
  to 1999\, having been president of the Assembly from 1997 to 1999.\n\nNew
  leader: El Salvador\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francisco_Flor
 es_P%C3%A9rez\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
