DESCRIPTION:The Iranian student protests of July 1999 were student protests
  which were violently repressed by the Basij and Ansar-e Hezbollah. Before
  the 2009 Iranian election protests\, they were the most widespread and vi
 olent public protests to occur in Iran since the early years of the Irania
 n Revolution.\n\nProtest: Iran\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999
