 o served as the prime minister of Belgium from 1999 to 2008. He was a memb
 er of the European Parliament (MEP) from Belgium from 2009 until 2024. Ver
 hofstadt was a member of the Belgian Chamber of Representatives from 1985 
 to 2009.\n\nNew leader: Belgium\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guy
