DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19990922
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 1999 Jiji earthquake (Taiwan)
DESCRIPTION:The Chi-Chi earthquake\, was a 7.3 ML or 7.7 Mw earthquake whic
 h occurred in Jiji (Chi-Chi)\, Nantou County\, Taiwan on September 21\, 19
 99\, at 01:47:12 local time. 2\,415 people were killed\, 11\,305 injured\,
  and NT$300 billion worth of damage was done. It is the second-deadliest e
 arthquake in Taiwan's recorded history\, after the 1935 Shinchiku-Taichū 
 earthquake.\n\nCrisis: Taiwan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_
 Jiji_earthquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev)
 .
