DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19990927
SUMMARY:1999 Tajik constitutional referendum (Tajikistan)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Tajikistan on 26 Septem
 ber 1999. The changes included legalising religious political parties\, in
 troducing a bicameral parliament\, and lengthening the president's term fr
 om five to seven years. They were approved by 75% of voters\, with a turno
 ut of 93%.\n\nReferendum: Tajikistan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
 i/1999_Tajik_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
 ia PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
