DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Austria on 3 October 1999.
  Although the Social Democratic Party remained the largest party in the Na
 tional Council\, a right-wing coalition government was formed by the Freed
 om Party of Austria (FPÖ) and the Austrian People's Party (ÖVP) after se
 veral months of negotiations.\n\nElection: Austria\nSource: https://en.wik
