DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19991004
SUMMARY:1999 Abkhazian constitutional referendum (Republic of Abkhazia)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Abkhazia on 3 October 1
 999\, alongside presidential elections. Voters were asked whether they app
 roved of the constitution that had been approved by the Supreme Soviet on 
 26 November 1994\, together with an amendment abolishing the life term for
  appointed judges and replacing it with five year terms.\n\nReferendum: Re
 public of Abkhazia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Abkhazian_c
 onstitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.p
