SUMMARY:Coup: 1999 Pakistani coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:The 1999 military takeover in Pakistan was a bloodless coup d'
 état initiated by the military staff at the Joint Staff HQ working under 
 the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff Committee and Chief of Army Staf
 f General Pervez Musharraf.\n\nCoup: Pakistan\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/1999_Pakistani_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
 0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
