 rs in the country's political leadership—Prime Minister Vazgen Sargsyan 
 and…\n\nAssassination: Armenia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ar
 menian_parliament_shooting\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi
