DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19991031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19991101
SUMMARY:1999 Uruguayan referendum
DESCRIPTION:A double referendum was held in Uruguay on 31 October 1999 alon
 gside general elections. Voters were asked two questions\; whether they ap
 proved of two initiatives\, one on the financial autonomy of the judiciary
 \, and one on preventing directors of state-owned companies from becoming 
 MPs. Both were rejected by voters.\n\nReferendum: Uruguay\nSource: https:/
 /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Uruguayan_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-S
 A 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
