SUMMARY:1999 Guatemalan general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Guatemala on 7 November 1999\, w
 ith a second round of the presidential elections on 26 December. Alfonso P
 ortillo won the presidential elections\, whilst his Guatemalan Republican 
 Front also won a majority of Congressional seats. Voter turnout was 53.8% 
 on 7 November and 40.4% on 26 December.\n\nElection: Guatemala\nSource: ht
 tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Guatemalan_general_election\nText: Wikipe
