SUMMARY:1999 Russian legislative election (Soviet Union / Russia)
DESCRIPTION:Legislative elections were held in Russia on 19 December 1999 t
 o elect the 450 seats in the State Duma\, the lower house of the Federal A
 ssembly. Like in the previous elections in 1995\, the electoral system res
 ulted in many parties competing for the proportional seats and a significa
 nt number of independent deputies elected.\n\nElection: Soviet Union / Rus
 sia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1999_Russian_legislative_electi
 on\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
