SUMMARY:Mugur Isărescu takes power (Romania)
DESCRIPTION:Constantin Mugur Isărescu is the governor of the National Bank
  of Romania\, a position he has been holding since September 1990\, with t
 he sole exception of a period of time of one year\, during which he served
  as Prime Minister of Romania. In addition\, he is also a member of the Ro
 manian Academy. Isărescu is a member of The Trilateral Commission.\n\nNew
  leader: Romania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mugur_Is%C4%83resc
 u\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
